<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates up at end-Feb.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates up at end-Feb.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa beans in store as of the end of February/early March. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		    Total     Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM	 572,000   35,033.754 (incl 989.995 forw sales)</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN  137,000   15,512.218</p>
<p>ANTWERP	    97,059   2,031.681 (incl 1,449.828 forw sales)</p>
<p>UK (ALL PORTS)   59,185   3,784.990 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM	  14,700   9,428.894 (incl    74.650 forw sales)</p>
<p>The data give the following changes to month-earlier levels:</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM	   UP  56,000</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN    UP  15,000</p>
<p>ANTWERP	     UP  10,809</p>
</text>
